  title: Short Circuit Diagnosis
  goal: Recognize evaluator-confirmed short-circuit conditions.
  steps:
  - title: Read the evaluator
    instruction: First check whether the official level evaluator reports a source
      or target short.
    hint: This is an authored educational example. Compare it to verified measurements
      in your current level.
